{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension","doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/Foundation","doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/Foundation\/URLSession"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CachedDataTaskPublisher"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/UserGuide"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/Foundation\/URLSession\/cachedDataTaskPublisher(for:)-8dwfl","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the stale-while-revalidate counterpart of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/foundation\/urlsession\/datataskpublisher","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a view can show what it last received at once, then update when the request completes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cached response is read without touching the network. When the cache holds none, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds an error response, the publisher skips straight to the request: only a successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response stands in for the one the request loads."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The request is then performed with its own cache policy. Transient failures — network"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"errors and the error responses "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/Api\/ErrorResponseType\/recoverable","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" covers — are retried"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up to three times, and any error response then fails the publisher with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/Api\/ResponseError","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", as described in "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/documentation\/URLSessionExtension\/UserGuide#Retrying-failed-requests","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the request’s response has the same data and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"total"},{"type":"text","text":" header as the cached one, it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not published again. A paginated endpoint reports its element count in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"total"},{"type":"text","text":", so a page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose count changed is published even when its elements did not."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A failure of the request ends the publisher after the cached response, if there was one, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"subscriber that keeps the last value received still has it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/urlsessionextension\/foundation\/urlsession\/cacheddatataskpublisher"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/URLSessionExtension\/7Combine9PublisherP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguag